Information=English Language for sevenc-nanashi/aviutl2-scripts / https://github.com/sevenc-nanashi/aviutl2-scripts
[Tips.縦動画ガイド]
effect.name=Displays guides for areas hidden by the Niconico Shorts UI.\n\n┌ ℹ️ Note\n│ By default, this object is hidden during export.\n│ Enable "Show on Export" if you also want it to appear in exported output.\n└──────\n
PI=- `device`: Device\n  - `1`: iPhone 16 (iOS 26)\n  - `2`: iPad mini (iPadOS 26)\n- `color`: Color (`0xRRGGBB`)\n- `show_forward`: Whether to show the pinned video area\n- `show_tags`: Whether to show tags\n- `author_name_width`: Author name width in pixels\n- `side_line_width`: Side line width in pixels\n- `show_on_output`: Whether to show during export\n- `layout`: Layout settings. Values such as `width`, `height`, and `footer_height` can be overridden with a table.\n

